{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2021-09-21 10:38:00', 'title': 'SURVEY OF MIDDLE MARKET COMPANIES REVEALS INCREASING IMPORTANCE OF RISK MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'WHITEHOUSE STATION, N.J., SEPT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NEW DATA FROM CHUBB AND THE NATIONAL CENTER FOR THE MIDDLE MARKET (NCMM), HOUSED AT THE OHIO STATE UNIVERSITY FISHER COLLEGE OF BUSINESS, SHOWS THAT MIDDLE MARKET COMPANIES ARE FINDING RISK MANAGEMENT INCREASINGLY IMPORTANT AFTER MORE THAN A YEAR OF DEALING WITH PANDEMIC-RELATED AND OTHER DISRUPTIONS.'}